{"id": "official:sentence:8156745f-09fd-4d0c-8d24-b642ef114913", "text": "他思考着现代生活的复杂性。", "shortMeaning": "他在想现代日子有多复杂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:368b4e77-4bec-47a9-b603-5c189348bf8f", "text": "他急忙出了办公室。", "shortMeaning": "他急匆匆出了办公室。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7ac2436-5629-4944-97b9-51a6c630737f", "text": "他急忙地离开办公室。", "shortMeaning": "他慌忙离开了办公室。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb4a5818-cb8d-403a-b048-b1c37ecec884", "text": "他急急忙忙地离开了办公室。", "shortMeaning": "他三步并两步离开了办公室。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a91d15a3-726c-4279-8bbe-3530a7b66a4e", "text": "他急着把电话放下了。", "shortMeaning": "他忙不迭把电话挂了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac575768-ebcb-44d1-bd0e-1ec774fab11f", "text": "他总是对我很亲切。", "shortMeaning": "他待我总是一团和气。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8c56fbf2-c065-4aa2-a5a3-ba307b38be4d", "text": "他总是对我很友好。", "shortMeaning": "他对我一向和善。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02f79708-faf6-412e-afc9-64b3b37e71e9", "text": "他总是带着黑色眼镜。", "shortMeaning": "他总戴着一副黑眼镜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:21a30660-40a3-4936-931e-2d55b0767977", "text": "他总是抱怨伙食不好。", "shortMeaning": "他老嫌饭菜差。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e1e9abed-0cd9-4335-9c25-3b4996150a85", "text": "他总是抱怨这抱怨那。", "shortMeaning": "他这也嫌那也嫌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:104f2525-2061-428e-a1ad-9ccd36448cdf", "text": "他总是挑别人的毛病。", "shortMeaning": "他专爱挑旁人的刺。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2eb19e87-3189-4f7e-89bb-a23f87a5c644", "text": "他总是犯同样的错误。", "shortMeaning": "同一个错他总犯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f35d3bb5-4de4-406e-8d62-82ee1ca45145", "text": "他总有一天会回日本去。", "shortMeaning": "他早晚要回日本。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:40096c5b-8442-45f6-9f79-c331b6bfc748", "text": "他总有一天要返回日本。", "shortMeaning": "日本他迟早要回去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6a1b8930-2f28-4a2f-9b24-1609318cd3ec", "text": "他总问同样的问题。", "shortMeaning": "他一遍遍问同一个问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dae1ea47-7262-45d7-98a1-9de7b7950c14", "text": "他恢复了意识，还能开口说话了。", "shortMeaning": "他醒过神来，也能开口讲话了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b092cf18-a74f-43f0-8d4b-68e74fbf9403", "text": "他悄悄地递给我一张纸条。", "shortMeaning": "他偷偷塞给我一张纸条。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5f7512e0-88fa-4116-ab36-fc508583886a", "text": "他患有性别焦虑症。", "shortMeaning": "他有性别焦虑的毛病。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:51a18660-2b3f-4298-9fff-786ff9176dce", "text": "他悲伤的故事触动了我的心。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的那些苦事打动了我的心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:67a4b757-073a-4fd8-8557-2e43adf3c1a9", "text": "他想切一道，然后切着自己了。", "shortMeaning": "他想切一刀，反倒切到了自己。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b3420eb3-fe57-4f51-aee1-09fe4ea88d2c", "text": "他想到一个好主意。", "shortMeaning": "他心里冒出个好主意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6b7bf4fd-e4dc-48a9-92f5-67a157c5fcab", "text": "他想到了一个绝妙的想法。", "shortMeaning": "他忽然想出个极妙的念头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7472d498-dab0-485d-8e82-8ca77521a734", "text": "他想和我们一起来。", "shortMeaning": "他想跟我们一道来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d40b237d-ceb0-4a5e-905a-d676239be824", "text": "他想得到一本新的字典。", "shortMeaning": "他想弄一本新字典。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf668e26-bd7b-4d67-9000-8961304568c8", "text": "他想成为一名作家。", "shortMeaning": "他盼着能当上作家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:176e969d-1873-467e-ac28-b8126a111e88", "text": "他想找一位金发碧眼的欧洲女人。", "shortMeaning": "他想找个金发碧眼的欧洲女子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f1c9005e-4b2e-4a45-9b29-f2d2ca549f00", "text": "他想游泳渡河的企图失败了。", "shortMeaning": "他想游过河，没能成。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b3e4cf9-def5-4a78-89c6-57daea8dccd9", "text": "他想要减少进口品的税。", "shortMeaning": "他想把进口货的税降下来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:42db49df-e06f-4eae-bed5-fd73c56e5c04", "text": "他想进一步了解他们。", "shortMeaning": "他想再多了解他们一些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e6d97f0f-12f6-4b37-9275-6209e7ed9b1f", "text": "他意识到他面临危险。", "shortMeaning": "他明白自己正处在险处。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b76d16ce-a22a-427b-82ab-d824262bd649", "text": "他感觉到了责任重大。", "shortMeaning": "他觉得肩上的担子很重。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cfd451f1-5c2e-410d-80e2-c8a176068ed9", "text": "他感觉就好像有东西爬上了他的腿。", "shortMeaning": "他觉得像有东西爬上了腿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:91d4a831-3ab3-4e73-9b05-eff56c863f57", "text": "他愣在原地，无言以对。", "shortMeaning": "他呆站着，说不出话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4f3eabdb-2c49-45df-93af-de772574af55", "text": "他慢慢地适应了黑暗。", "shortMeaning": "他渐渐看惯了黑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e6afd58c-c7ac-495a-b694-1a49cf2c7dc6", "text": "他成为了一个警察。", "shortMeaning": "他当上了警察。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19efeb57-537a-496a-8697-fb31fd5733ca", "text": "他成为了著名的歌手。", "shortMeaning": "他成了有名的歌手。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b89e1de-454f-438d-a299-0da330aebb93", "text": "他成功地游过了河。", "shortMeaning": "他一气游到了对岸。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35f3f58e-4b7a-4d3b-ba2a-cafab0b24903", "text": "他或许不会再庆祝春节了。", "shortMeaning": "他也许不再过春节了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5704eb59-5be6-42c4-a7ca-fec3ae515ae1", "text": "他所说的一切是真的。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的句句是真。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e2f1ae20-0460-4192-8e10-3271dce4b449", "text": "他手上拿了一把草。", "shortMeaning": "他手里攥着一把草。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f1a41fe2-c452-4831-9e13-2a043c5e2843", "text": "他手里拿着一本书。", "shortMeaning": "他手上捧着一本书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1aed4b30-b8ea-43a3-97d5-8aec7dde4790", "text": "他才从图书馆回来。", "shortMeaning": "他刚从图书馆回来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d73f43b-39f0-4279-94cf-b7023d8d9884", "text": "他才是真有风骨的人了！", "shortMeaning": "真正有骨气的还得数他！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c03edea-6a2a-46dd-8ace-8fcb0b8493a1", "text": "他打出租车以及时赶到。", "shortMeaning": "为了赶上，他叫了出租车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eb13541d-3b86-44c2-8e02-4ddf9b7fc659", "text": "他打断了我们的谈论。", "shortMeaning": "他把我们的话头打断了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:585b81b3-02de-4288-96f7-c0b9f751859a", "text": "他打着见我的幌子来了我家。", "shortMeaning": "他借口来看我，到了我家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4fbc50c6-fd68-4234-bfb2-a69a3b4fefab", "text": "他打算在这里一直等到她的出现。", "shortMeaning": "他打算在这儿一直等到她来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5cb28b9d-f0e6-4d85-a331-71eb3a2bf705", "text": "他打网球打得很好。", "shortMeaning": "他网球打得好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5075f0e5-7a92-470c-9eb5-3b39157f147f", "text": "他扔了很多旧信件。", "shortMeaning": "他把许多旧信丢了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d07d4613-4d0b-4826-bcba-4e29cfcb7784", "text": "他执意不惜一切代价获得成功。", "shortMeaning": "他非要成功，什么都不顾。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:abb10009-93a1-4ead-bfd2-33a6bc9572e2", "text": "他扮演哈姆雷特的角色。", "shortMeaning": "哈姆雷特这个角色由他扮演。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5a1d9e53-0b1d-4a42-94c4-baf667c29a75", "text": "他找到我的自行车。", "shortMeaning": "我的自行车被他找到了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:53d111ad-c1f2-42cf-bdd2-98d70a2f54ab", "text": "他找到的箱子是空的。", "shortMeaning": "他找着的那只箱子里面空着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2f37b33-2702-4de4-842b-3749c3574103", "text": "他承认了自己的错误。", "shortMeaning": "他认了自己的错。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c3172c8-a2e1-426d-b619-3340b4485270", "text": "他承认自己与这宗丑闻有牵连。", "shortMeaning": "他认了，那桩丑闻他脱不了干系。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:684d0a97-6091-4c59-8a92-25d4991d76c9", "text": "他承诺给这个地区带来新的工业，但是政治家很少完成他们的承诺。", "shortMeaning": "他许下给本地引来新工业，可政客的话少有算数。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:009d1f43-80d9-4cff-9c34-8ac6b9f567d4", "text": "他把一张照片挂在墙上。", "shortMeaning": "他往墙上挂了一张相片。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fda72c9f-f09f-4209-bc0e-4fc1ef784148", "text": "他把一本日语小说翻译成了法语。", "shortMeaning": "他把一本日文小说译成了法语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7b5ac414-2870-4e9d-a870-f569575b99df", "text": "他把一盏灯挂在了天花板上。", "shortMeaning": "他把一盏灯吊到了天花板上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7cdb9465-d4ee-4578-b901-a1b8b2fedc5a", "text": "他把一间厂房租给人当冷藏库了。", "shortMeaning": "他把一间厂房租出去作冷库。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19aeace6-3aeb-4198-813b-df4f17e4e220", "text": "他把书放在了书架上。", "shortMeaning": "他把书搁在书架上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:78932612-8a0f-41c2-889a-8ff62a4dfa87", "text": "他把书放在了桌上。", "shortMeaning": "他把书放到桌上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f58d15b3-6a88-404b-92fc-23adc3a6fdea", "text": "他把交通事故通知了警察。", "shortMeaning": "他把撞车的事报了警。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:701bc063-3cff-4a15-8394-7c28959d26b6", "text": "他把他所有的钱都给我了。", "shortMeaning": "他把钱全都给了我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9b4b7214-4fd6-4055-bcf7-931a03ff1f03", "text": "他把他的双手深深地插进了口袋。", "shortMeaning": "他两手深深插进衣袋。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ad19121e-673e-459c-a33c-1bf111f30829", "text": "他把他的成功归功于好运。", "shortMeaning": "他说自己成功靠的是运气。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e54dae7f-8f55-473a-b2d4-09cb3562e1bf", "text": "他把他的房子出租二十年了。", "shortMeaning": "他的房子已经租出去二十年。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5b4c539a-db2c-4a41-ba42-2534927389ea", "text": "他把他的手从桌上移开了。", "shortMeaning": "他把手从桌上挪开。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6b37a6c7-98ee-4789-b851-0303fb5f0dca", "text": "他把他的手插进了口袋。", "shortMeaning": "他把手伸进了衣袋。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8bced67c-ddd5-4fa4-a038-eca03f93ee20", "text": "他把他的手放在了我的肩上。", "shortMeaning": "他把手搭在我肩上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e744c84f-6898-4d50-b263-b25afe332a80", "text": "他把他的旅行推迟到明天了。", "shortMeaning": "他把行程推到明天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:486406dc-cf1e-4451-8281-93fb8332fdc0", "text": "他把他的生命给了国家。", "shortMeaning": "他把命交给了国家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:36be0dc7-ed2b-4c79-a172-d614ebfdd0a3", "text": "他把他的自行车刷成红色。", "shortMeaning": "他把自行车漆成了红色。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19a01148-9c98-4f9a-a64f-fbead0ad3071", "text": "他把他的车停在大楼后面。", "shortMeaning": "他把车停到楼后头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0f9a0b2b-819e-4920-af6d-c073362bde5e", "text": "他把他的那段话从磁带里删除了。", "shortMeaning": "他把那一段话从录音带上抹了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4edd2077-ccc2-476d-b4da-8bda9cdc3703", "text": "他把他的错误归咎于坏运气。", "shortMeaning": "他把自己出错怪在运气差上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:28666a48-f304-478c-864c-52aa7c4e7b09", "text": "他把信撕成碎片，扔出了窗外。", "shortMeaning": "他把信撕碎，扔到窗外。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0abed09e-b127-4496-9fda-86ded2f8b275", "text": "他把信读了一遍又一遍。", "shortMeaning": "那封信他翻来覆去读。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b2f5bc79-1e94-4e72-8a4e-7022925a51bd", "text": "他把信递给了秘书。", "shortMeaning": "他把信交给秘书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c6dcec37-fcb5-42cd-98b6-17d3926c7788", "text": "他把全部精力放到实验中了。", "shortMeaning": "他把心思全用在实验上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:679ac1b0-5d74-49df-a032-3239d5c2dbfe", "text": "他把出发推时到明天了。", "shortMeaning": "他动身的日期推到明天了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e3495d5c-977a-47e2-a95a-01649ca98e15", "text": "他把包放在桌子下面。", "shortMeaning": "他把包放在桌下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d6cb1ca9-7ef2-43b6-93d9-8f58b5a44383", "text": "他把外套随手折叠好，压在了枕头下面。", "shortMeaning": "他把外套叠了叠，塞到枕头下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2d6e23e8-254b-41a4-ad07-1c248d62c4aa", "text": "他把大部分时间都投入到了工作中。", "shortMeaning": "他的工夫大半花在工作上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:238db805-79af-4949-abc3-18f79bd41795", "text": "他把天花板刷成了蓝色。", "shortMeaning": "他把房顶刷成了蓝的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bc731321-a726-4c9d-912a-469f393442c9", "text": "他把奖杯高高举起。", "shortMeaning": "他把奖杯高举起来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:496a41ef-f805-43d6-b799-df579aa712a2", "text": "他把奖金存到银行了。", "shortMeaning": "他把奖金存进了银行。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9dd39788-4900-4709-9c25-117543c913bd", "text": "他把她叫到一边，把那个消息告诉了她。", "shortMeaning": "他把她叫到一旁，说了那消息。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:81abea48-91bc-4c66-a0f8-a2205075f2f9", "text": "他把她的包给她了。", "shortMeaning": "他把包还给了她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c25aa2b6-7634-419a-84f1-92eb55a8fc7d", "text": "他把她的话当作是一种赞美。", "shortMeaning": "他把她的那句话当成夸奖。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ed5878d-45bf-486e-98f7-abdb369328ee", "text": "他把它藏在了门后。", "shortMeaning": "他把它藏在门后头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:debe559d-bc57-4bc0-8384-ed55fea8afae", "text": "他把屋子重新装修了。", "shortMeaning": "他把屋子重又拾掇了一遍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:db5e99ec-63a0-4dbd-a2df-e8359144df16", "text": "他把座位让给了一个老人，这显示出他很有礼貌。", "shortMeaning": "他把位子让给老人，显得很有礼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6627fb1-5d90-4860-b008-aa6d5743f85a", "text": "他把徽章别在马甲上。", "shortMeaning": "他把徽章别在坎肩上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7e553185-ebcc-4e46-85c3-70380a433e19", "text": "他把我从头到脚打量了一番。", "shortMeaning": "他把我上下打量了一遍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c8fc863-a3cb-49e3-a5ba-a77ffabee0d0", "text": "他把我忘了，难道不是吗？", "shortMeaning": "他把我忘了，难道不是？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eb8c5214-df76-43e3-9ced-d65ca9f96027", "text": "他把我的病给医好了。", "shortMeaning": "他把我的病治好了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:17e18027-e8f5-4d4d-b688-fd9e9b1c0039", "text": "他把所有他借来的钱还了。", "shortMeaning": "借来的钱他全还了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:efc98617-8839-402a-b1c7-b9f97c93725c", "text": "他把手插进了口袋。", "shortMeaning": "他伸手揣进了兜里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:762f9ed9-650d-4ad2-9dd0-44e36edf2777", "text": "他把整个苹果都吃了。", "shortMeaning": "整个苹果他一人吃了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2fa8d01e-68a7-42f3-b154-42bfb8c462b1", "text": "他把杯子举到嘴边，一饮而尽。", "shortMeaning": "他把杯里的东西一口喝干。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a70661f-8509-4ce1-9820-ba545fbf31cf", "text": "他把杯子掉到地板上打碎了。", "shortMeaning": "他一失手，杯子掉在地上碎了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7fa3bede-a54b-4ea5-8428-e4560d6249d0", "text": "他把滑板放上了车顶。", "shortMeaning": "他把滑板搁到车顶上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8728dba9-038c-46c1-ba03-cdf17dbc49ad", "text": "他把狗拴在一棵树上。", "shortMeaning": "他把狗系在树上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6bf6b715-1f3a-4646-833d-c20ce5e6dbdc", "text": "他把瓶子灌满了水。", "shortMeaning": "瓶子里给他灌满了水。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f2102751-78b8-4907-b9e9-662943ea0808", "text": "他把眼镜落在我们这里了。", "shortMeaning": "他的眼镜落在我们这儿了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cdbbe012-c278-49ec-92e6-720d355a5c2d", "text": "他把自己当成了这里的主人。", "shortMeaning": "他自以为是这儿的主人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e9359dd7-e38c-4965-a119-6f126d0e705a", "text": "他把自己的计划告诉了她。", "shortMeaning": "他把自己的打算说给她听。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5e1aa04c-ee69-49d7-831c-d0c3c8ecf5d7", "text": "他把自己的钱包掉到地上，现在是我的了。", "shortMeaning": "他的钱包掉在地上，如今归我了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d098e7e9-a540-428d-b6b5-f9c78c3e071a", "text": "他把自己视为救世主。", "shortMeaning": "他把自己看成救世的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:472f6e19-c566-4685-8687-9d8ca618b58f", "text": "他把苹果分成两部分。", "shortMeaning": "他把苹果剖成两半。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:31554c28-1d89-40cb-b919-e1a0a2f00540", "text": "他把荷马的史记从希腊语翻译成了英语。", "shortMeaning": "他把荷马史诗从希腊文译成英文。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:836521a3-a72d-4046-864a-0c49d42d9dc8", "text": "他把菜里的蒜都挑出来了。", "shortMeaning": "他把菜里的蒜全拣了出来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f605d6f-1c23-4b91-9452-6063c8e86fe4", "text": "他把衣服里外穿反了。", "shortMeaning": "他把衣服穿反了面。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f6a73e2c-a693-474f-859c-6190480b5411", "text": "他把诗翻译成英语。", "shortMeaning": "他把那首诗译成了英文。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d4456511-17e9-4e31-a781-10a69b992779", "text": "他把身子靠在胳膊上。", "shortMeaning": "他用胳膊支着身子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:34f2585e-09aa-400e-953d-33f78b4fff0e", "text": "他把车停在大楼前。", "shortMeaning": "他把车停在楼前。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2ee7caa0-3179-4798-97b6-ab880a75cf9c", "text": "他把这个奖视为最高荣誉。", "shortMeaning": "他把这奖看作最高的光荣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bcd0767d-dac8-4b38-841c-a32aea8f3666", "text": "他把这个盒子放到了桌子上。", "shortMeaning": "他把这只盒子搁到桌上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:892d6aae-da83-4c63-a1b2-257f9a0e39d4", "text": "他把这记在他的笔记本上。", "shortMeaning": "他把这事记在了本子上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f2ad654b-cd78-4bc4-b1d2-6509f59dc8a3", "text": "他把那么难做的活儿丢给我。", "shortMeaning": "那样难办的活他甩给了我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e2847d69-2054-4244-9efa-da5d80a14240", "text": "他把那视作了委婉的批评。", "shortMeaning": "他把那话当成含蓄的责备。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d7906de-b680-420d-8fdc-6bc1a5fc52d1", "text": "他把钱塞到我的口袋里。", "shortMeaning": "他把钱塞进我的衣袋。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cd467734-c459-4727-95b3-5b249dc9d868", "text": "他把铅笔拿在手上。", "shortMeaning": "他手里拿着铅笔。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3f92b0b5-2f77-4462-9bf3-02151aefbd89", "text": "他把铅笔放在了桌子上。", "shortMeaning": "他把铅笔放在桌上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bc2a4844-bda7-4c3a-80cb-bc11bf3f25f1", "text": "他把问题从脑子里排除了。", "shortMeaning": "他把这事从脑子里撇开了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e17f0b40-5280-40cc-a466-8a50569c6302", "text": "他抓住了她的胳膊。", "shortMeaning": "他一把抓住她的胳膊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:38df6ffc-cc49-4355-850c-daaf346198da", "text": "他抓住了我的手臂。", "shortMeaning": "他拽住了我的胳膊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:176c8ae9-a95a-45e7-8958-76282c4c1f67", "text": "他抓住了我的脖子。", "shortMeaning": "他掐住了我的脖子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ed08c3b3-fe3f-44c9-af39-9f3fef8ef609", "text": "他抓起一根钢管和持刀的歹徒对峙。", "shortMeaning": "他抄起钢管，跟拿刀的歹徒相持。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aac0a0d2-3ac0-4953-943e-bea5583fee9f", "text": "他抱怨菜的味道不好。", "shortMeaning": "他嫌这菜味道不行。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:da2f8e68-c16f-4d5c-bd08-a8736c347cba", "text": "他担心他父亲的身体。", "shortMeaning": "他惦记父亲的身子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b388fbf-2070-4338-9e51-30178e92a32e", "text": "他拉开了包的拉链。", "shortMeaning": "他把包的拉锁拉开了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c5e05c71-6b83-4a2b-ad28-e28595ddbad6", "text": "他拉开裤子的拉链。", "shortMeaning": "他把裤子拉链拉了下来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a11f7fde-988b-4519-9ce9-56056dc1268f", "text": "他拍了拍我的肩膀。", "shortMeaning": "他拍了一下我的肩头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0ee0cbe6-61fb-4d5c-b744-5b74c8f45979", "text": "他拒绝了她的追求。", "shortMeaning": "她追他，他没应。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b2ebb016-b2fc-4913-bade-e38ef42eff59", "text": "他拒绝了我们的邀请。", "shortMeaning": "我们的邀请他回掉了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:927a1057-8e45-40df-8860-7a034600f332", "text": "他拒绝了我加好友的请求。", "shortMeaning": "我想加他好友，他没答应。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49690786-842f-4450-92f9-fbc4d29bc380", "text": "他拒绝给他们提供信息。", "shortMeaning": "他不肯把消息给他们。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c0c867e3-75ac-45b7-b50b-ede3551e001e", "text": "他拔起杂草就扔掉。", "shortMeaning": "他薅起杂草随手就丢。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b810945e-92e3-45ed-9686-a513a36b4cf1", "text": "他拥有出国留学两年的特权。", "shortMeaning": "他有出国读两年书的特权。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d7d8369-aa29-44aa-8ca2-9650e17541a6", "text": "他拥有的书是我拥有的三倍。", "shortMeaning": "他的书有我的三倍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f8097344-3267-4145-97aa-60dd49ba7145", "text": "他拥有的书比我的多。", "shortMeaning": "他的藏书比我的多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dea3b491-fad6-40be-abfc-60721b3f6c38", "text": "他拥有非常丰富的想象力。", "shortMeaning": "他的想象极丰富。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e6c35c8-ae53-4b71-92d7-58f7c3ef42df", "text": "他拼了命的要靠岸。", "shortMeaning": "他拼着命往岸边靠。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:efba9562-40b1-4ea7-91aa-e1661952f1a5", "text": "他拿了100万美元的退休金。", "shortMeaning": "他领了一百万美元的退休金。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c3a7c870-ec42-4e62-a07a-5a09b8e9e75c", "text": "他拿了面镜子细看自己的舌头。", "shortMeaning": "他拿镜子细瞧自己的舌头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a465b223-63f9-4a70-9b7a-406c0cac5e81", "text": "他拿出了几枚硬币。", "shortMeaning": "他掏出几个硬币。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a9949dac-265a-43dd-ad82-1deab7a349b3", "text": "他拿到了很大一笔钱。", "shortMeaning": "他到手一大笔钱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:359bb115-9a09-4276-9576-de5dfcf20eb3", "text": "他拿到了现代文学的文凭。", "shortMeaning": "他得了现代文学的文凭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3e73f683-4bd4-41db-8d68-0d0e2558f2bb", "text": "他拿的薪水是我的一倍。", "shortMeaning": "他的工钱是我的两倍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d8df569-6272-4a2c-8380-8991b09ffaf1", "text": "他拿着一个装满了苹果的袋子。", "shortMeaning": "他提着一袋苹果。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1fc4e0d9-d48f-451b-bdef-b4b89569d812", "text": "他指出了遵守法律的重要性。", "shortMeaning": "他强调守法要紧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a3d4154a-6824-4f80-99e0-b3fbdc4e40c6", "text": "他指控我偷了他的手表。", "shortMeaning": "他告我偷了他的表。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2c7b0a39-d7b6-4bd0-8256-3768c88278c2", "text": "他按照字面上的意思。", "shortMeaning": "他照字面那层意思来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35b2fd21-e6ac-45f8-b73d-c06ff3e0c2b6", "text": "他排挤了他的对手。", "shortMeaning": "他把对手挤到一边去了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6a384eac-0818-4722-b5bb-553a2afd2ed5", "text": "他探索一切逃走的可能性。", "shortMeaning": "凡能逃的法子他都试过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:75779340-0039-484b-917d-6cc81c6099de", "text": "他接受了他的失败。", "shortMeaning": "他认了自己的败。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca1d6732-94f8-474e-9252-2d18124b4ffa", "text": "他接受了我的主意。", "shortMeaning": "他采纳了我的主意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8c9071b8-ba78-44ff-825d-c7554ae7806a", "text": "他接受了我的意见。", "shortMeaning": "我的意见他听了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a7ceec3b-379c-44ef-98c4-41722fe98814", "text": "他掷骰子之前让他的女友在上面吹气来给他带来好运。", "shortMeaning": "掷骰子前他让女友朝上吹气讨个好运。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1d39a956-3c9c-4850-a018-5e0e20879b17", "text": "他提供的比预期的多。", "shortMeaning": "他给的比原先想的要多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:185ac3cc-d0ae-404a-9f74-1fe35e3eac25", "text": "他提出了一种新理论。", "shortMeaning": "他拿出了一套新说法。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c67cdf83-4c19-499c-ba65-40710e238b92", "text": "他提出改革研究方法的意见。", "shortMeaning": "他建议改一改研究的路子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:851588b0-c99e-4a59-97d4-766abc105382", "text": "他提议大家一起去游泳。", "shortMeaning": "他叫大伙儿一道去游泳。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:31e17bcd-1026-4ee3-b7a6-f495b9ae8969", "text": "他提议对教育系统进行改革。", "shortMeaning": "他提议把教育办法改一改。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca1a0ea9-ab4e-4505-b73b-04bb693698ab", "text": "他搬到了我家附近。", "shortMeaning": "他搬到我家左近住。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:de5e466d-f46a-40b3-96d7-73d871abf2db", "text": "他摆出一副无辜的样子。", "shortMeaning": "他装出一副没干过的模样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a8cf70ed-4d22-4c64-8325-2ebe6f507d0c", "text": "他摔倒后没有起来。", "shortMeaning": "他跌倒以后没再起身。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6df6426f-d078-4c7c-b68f-686ba1bc6c99", "text": "他摔倒的时候弄伤了手。", "shortMeaning": "他摔跤时把手弄伤了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1b5fb23a-5807-4c2a-83ec-8cafe2ceb4b0", "text": "他撞车是因为有人在刹车上做了手脚。", "shortMeaning": "有人动了刹车，他才撞了车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f67a80a8-905d-45ed-abe0-c5b04bdd298b", "text": "他擅长解答数学难题。", "shortMeaning": "数学难题他解得来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e526d4f4-e3b8-4de7-8b75-b057549e645b", "text": "他操一口流利的英语。", "shortMeaning": "他英语说得很顺。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3e95688f-68a7-4916-9dca-36cc6ca178ee", "text": "他擦去了脸上的汗水。", "shortMeaning": "他把脸上的汗抹掉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a6d581b0-fc7c-4510-8a5e-380889d33f9d", "text": "他收到了一封她的信，但上面只有简短的、冷漠的几句话。", "shortMeaning": "她来了封信，只有几句冷淡的短话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7738173-8572-4b93-9f5c-59306484d29a", "text": "他收起了他的玩具。", "shortMeaning": "他把玩具收了起来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:415965bf-92be-4d58-95b2-bc7bf8e39797", "text": "他放弃了成为飞行员的梦想。", "shortMeaning": "他不再想做飞行员了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bedc8760-aef1-4cb6-86f8-3bb6782f6cf0", "text": "他放弃了所有希望。", "shortMeaning": "他把所有指望都丢了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fc2bda56-f173-4ec6-a141-a825777b807e", "text": "他放我鸽子；我等了他一整晚！", "shortMeaning": "他放了我鸽子，我白等了一夜！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:485f9c28-53cd-43cd-8cb6-6fa4e97dd6fc", "text": "他放火烧了自己的房子。", "shortMeaning": "他纵火把自己的房子点了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79dd5a64-a9f9-478c-92a4-f12134af649b", "text": "他故意令她陷入险境。", "shortMeaning": "他有意让她落到险地里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b35b36f9-8f43-47b4-9d22-331e358b2d94", "text": "他故意做出不在乎的样子。", "shortMeaning": "他成心摆出满不在乎的架势。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c02f6cff-0dcd-4414-8c0d-2ec0d942c1d4", "text": "他救了一个溺水的男孩。", "shortMeaning": "他救起一个落水的男孩。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f4803719-92d6-4b13-a0ce-2af95258d50b", "text": "他教了我怎么拼这个词。", "shortMeaning": "他教我这个字怎么拼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9da5d8b-4402-4b22-8cab-fb55d8662038", "text": "他教会了他的侄子唱意大利语歌。", "shortMeaning": "他教会侄子唱意大利文歌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9de7f2ab-c669-440a-8215-14f7128690bf", "text": "他教过一群印度男生。", "shortMeaning": "他给一群印度男生上过课。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2940d338-41d3-4006-98aa-81c172fcadc1", "text": "他整理了他的房间。", "shortMeaning": "他把屋子收拾了一番。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dd4805f7-4d6b-431c-86b6-32b5c67760e9", "text": "他新近皈依的天主教徒。", "shortMeaning": "他刚入了天主教。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d6d70ab-bc69-4723-a91b-67d9f47c537b", "text": "他无权干涉我们的家庭事务。", "shortMeaning": "我们家里的事他管不着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:548752ee-bd90-4841-82b7-8acebbd25f05", "text": "他无法回答他们的问题。", "shortMeaning": "面对他们的提问，他答不出来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3f0caf93-07e3-4ad1-9c92-e83cd41d6be6", "text": "他无法让自己射鹿。", "shortMeaning": "他下不了手去射鹿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cac64089-1da5-4cb1-935d-dea2db3468f8", "text": "他无非是别人的跟屁虫。", "shortMeaning": "他不过是人家的跟班。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:990ddda6-01ec-4b6d-9c3b-4686c56e4f83", "text": "他既会打网球，又会打棒球。", "shortMeaning": "网球他会，棒球也会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:57ade702-d5d5-4d08-97d5-3121cd3559c7", "text": "他既精于数学又精于文学。", "shortMeaning": "他数学好，文章也精。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a7541dc-2b4c-4acd-b016-c5c95746b825", "text": "他早上总是有点脾气暴躁。", "shortMeaning": "他清早总要发点脾气。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:268c8902-738a-4e22-974a-648cb152e5bc", "text": "他早就知道自己不会赢。", "shortMeaning": "他早知道赢不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16102547-94d6-4741-8e7e-c56733a81b01", "text": "他早晚会全告诉我的。", "shortMeaning": "他迟早会把话全说给我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b080fa20-8ff1-43eb-975d-46fca49590bd", "text": "他明天出发去中国。", "shortMeaning": "他明天动身去中国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1beda3e3-32c5-47d3-974c-b4c75050eb2d", "text": "他昨天出发去加拿大了。", "shortMeaning": "他昨天动身去了加拿大。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fa2f70d9-f6f6-4e3e-a6b2-764c79005cde", "text": "他昨天病了，所以没来学校。", "shortMeaning": "他昨天身子不适，没到学校。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
